                                        "entry_id": "4ec04fd6-1121-3b0b-b856-8b92736f1254",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A Permic language in the Finno-Ugric branch of the Uralic language family, smaller of the two main regional varieties (ISO 639-3 language code: koi) of the pluricentrical Komi language, the other variety being Komi-Zyrian. It's the standard language of Komi people in Komi-Permyak Okrug."
